<title>MALAYSIA: Telekom plans 1-for-2 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Telekom plans 1-for-2 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telekom Malaysia Bhd said on Thursday it has proposed a one-for-two bonus issue.</p>
<p>In a statement accompanying its 1996 financial results, Telekom said the proposal is subject to approval by the regulatory authorities and shareholders.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
